WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.042 --> 00:00:02.085
Chloe Arnold:
One. two, three, four.

00:00:02.085 --> 00:00:03.128
Choreographer:
One. two, three!

00:00:03.462 --> 00:00:04.838
Chloe Arnold:
Ahh!

00:00:04.838 --> 00:00:05.297
(Clap!)

00:00:05.297 --> 00:00:11.220
Ryan, Will, and Octavia were so
open to learning the
choreography, that they went all in.

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:12.012
♪♪

00:00:12.012 --> 00:00:12.971
Chloe Arnold:
Lean and- that's it!

00:00:13.347 --> 00:00:15.265
Yes, right before the end.

00:00:15.265 --> 00:00:20.145
Rooster! Don’t- don’t try to
neuter the rooster, okay?

00:00:20.145 --> 00:00:21.146
♪♪

00:00:21.146 --> 00:00:22.105
Chloe Arnold:
They practiced hard.

00:00:22.105 --> 00:00:25.817
Chloe Arnold:
You’ll see the
challenge of how tap dance is so complicated

00:00:25.817 --> 00:00:29.321
but then simultaneously how
rewarding it is when they got
it.

00:00:29.321 --> 00:00:33.242
♪♪

00:00:33.242 --> 00:00:34.618
Chloe Arnold:
(Laughs) Yeah.

00:00:34.618 --> 00:00:35.327
♪♪

00:00:35.327 --> 00:00:35.869
Chloe Arnold:
Yes!

00:00:35.869 --> 00:00:38.997
♪♪

00:00:38.997 --> 00:00:40.457
Ryan Reynolds:
That is spectacular.

00:00:40.457 --> 00:00:43.293
Your socks really bring
the whole look together.

00:00:43.543 --> 00:00:44.795
♪♪

00:00:44.795 --> 00:00:46.296
Octavia Spencer:
Ahh!

00:00:46.296 --> 00:00:46.922
Chloe Arnold:
Yes!

00:00:46.922 --> 00:00:48.799
Something really magical!
-I don't even know.

00:00:48.799 --> 00:00:49.800
We’re coming for y'all...

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:51.093
♪We’re bringing back Christmas!♪

00:00:51.093 --> 00:00:54.638
In the end, they gave every bit
of their soul into this.

00:00:54.638 --> 00:00:56.515
Scrooge:
♪Plus a ton of cash!♪

00:00:56.848 --> 00:01:03.146
Scrooge &amp; Spirited Ensemble:
♪From some good ol’ fashion
trees!♪

00:01:03.146 --> 00:01:05.232
♪♪

